WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.427 --> 00:00:04.177
Unit twelve. Intro to Web Accessibility!

2
00:00:05.114 --> 00:00:10.143
Hello, everyone! I'm Mr. Daniel, your technology teacher.

3
00:00:10.193 --> 00:00:13.034
Hi, Mr. Daniel! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:13.084 --> 00:00:17.451
Today we learn about Intro to Web Accessibility. Let's go!

5
00:00:18.932 --> 00:00:24.249
Web accessibility. Say it with me. Web accessibility!

6
00:00:27.746 --> 00:00:32.633
Inclusive design. Say it with me. Inclusive design!

7
00:00:36.118 --> 00:00:40.084
Alt text. Say it with me. Alt text!

8
00:00:43.550 --> 00:00:48.879
Screen reader compatibility. Say it with me. Screen reader compatibility!

9
00:00:52.410 --> 00:00:57.110
Color contrast. Say it with me. Color contrast!

10
00:01:00.614 --> 00:01:05.280
Keyboard navigation. Say it with me. Keyboard navigation!

11
00:01:08.770 --> 00:01:13.959
Disability access. Say it with me. Disability access!

12
00:01:17.457 --> 00:01:22.207
Universal design. Say it with me. Universal design!

13
00:01:25.683 --> 00:01:37.812
Web accessibility ensures inclusive design for disability access. Alt text, screen reader compatibility, color contrast, and keyboard navigation support universal design.

14
00:01:37.862 --> 00:01:41.605
Now I understand. Thank you, Mr. Daniel!

15
00:01:42.325 --> 00:01:47.607
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:47.657 --> 00:01:48.807
Alt text!

17
00:01:49.933 --> 00:01:55.344
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:55.394 --> 00:01:57.140
Disability access!

19
00:01:58.193 --> 00:02:07.950
Did you know? Accessible websites often work better for everyone, not just for people with disabilities — it's called the 'curb-cut effect'!

20
00:02:08.000 --> 00:02:10.440
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:02:11.650 --> 00:02:21.550
Think and answer. Why is 'alt text' for images important for someone using a screen reader?

22
00:02:21.600 --> 00:02:22.750
Great answer!

23
00:02:24.003 --> 00:02:29.505
Great job today! Keep learning, and see you next time. Goodbye!

24
00:02:29.555 --> 00:02:32.732
Goodbye, everyone! See you next time!

